# Crafted Corsair Artifact (hidden quest CorArtifact), the Frac (Option 3, Raqtibahl): a level 99 Warrior in Port San
# d'Oria, Against All Odds completed (a GM), Option 3, Prog 1 and the red letter (GMs: Leleroon's 282 on 3 gives them,
# as the main flow shows on 2). Raqtibahl (default 759): the letter: 753 (Prog 2, the letter taken); 754; the gold
# chain, velvet, red grass cloth and sailcloth: 755 (Prog 3); 761; an Imperial Gold Piece: 760 (Prog 4, Timer,
# mustZone); 757; the Timer past and zoned: 756 (the Frac, Completed bit 2). Option 0 with the Frac made: 758. Option
# 1 (another commission, a GM): 758 too. Completed 7 (a GM) at Leleroon: nothing (264). With no room the piece's
# giveItem fails and nothing changes (the #gants flow). At Prog 2 the Bottes' and Gants' doors (Bastok Mines, Windurst
# Waters) ignore Option 3: their talk and their materials do nothing. Leleroon at Prog 4: 287; at Prog 5 (a GM):
# nothing.
lists Nashmau/onEventFinish/282 PortSanDoria/Raqtibahl/onTrigger PortSanDoria/Raqtibahl/onTrade PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/753 PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/755 PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/756 PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/760 Nashmau/Leleroon/onTrigger
char zone=Nashmau pos=-14.7,0,26.6 job=WAR lvl=99
quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
item Ruby
item GoldChain
item SquareOfVelvetCloth
item SquareOfRedGrassCloth
item SquareOfSailcloth
item ImperialGoldPiece
item MythrilSheet
item SquareOfKarakulLeather x2
item SquareOfLmBuffaloLeather
item SquareOfWolfFelt
item SpoolOfGoldThread
item SpoolOfWamouraSilk
login
trigger Leleroon                        # Prog 0: 282
finish option=3                         # the red letter; Option 3, Prog 1, Timer 0
trigger Leleroon                        # Prog 1, Option 3: 287
finish
warp -58.7,-4.5,-39.6 PortSanDoria
trade Raqtibahl GoldChain x1 SquareOfVelvetCloth x1 SquareOfRedGrassCloth x1 SquareOfSailcloth x1   # Prog 1: nothing
trigger Raqtibahl                       # the letter: 753
finish                                  # Prog 2, the letter taken
trigger Raqtibahl                       # Prog 2: 754
finish
warp 10.4,-1,-16 BastokMines            # beside the blue door: Option 3 is not its commission
trigger Door_House                      # nothing: this Door_House has no default, nothing plays
finish
trade Door_House MythrilSheet x1 SquareOfKarakulLeather x1 SquareOfLmBuffaloLeather x1 SquareOfWolfFelt x1   # nothing
warp -197.6,-5.4,-112 WindurstWaters    # beside the green door: not its commission either
trigger Door_House                      # nothing: the door's default
finish
trade Door_House SpoolOfGoldThread x1 SquareOfKarakulLeather x1 SquareOfRedGrassCloth x1 SpoolOfWamouraSilk x1   # nothing
warp -58.7,-4.5,-39.6 PortSanDoria
trade Raqtibahl Ruby x1                 # Prog 2, not the materials: nothing
trade Raqtibahl GoldChain x1 SquareOfVelvetCloth x1 SquareOfRedGrassCloth x1 SquareOfSailcloth x1   # 755
finish                                  # taken, Prog 3
trigger Raqtibahl                       # Prog 3: 761
finish
trade Raqtibahl Ruby x1                 # Prog 3, not the gold piece: nothing
trade Raqtibahl ImperialGoldPiece x1    # 760
finish                                  # taken, Prog 4, Timer tomorrow, mustZone
trigger Raqtibahl                       # Prog 4, not yet: 757
finish
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Timer 0      # a GM: the day past
warp -14.7,0,26.6 Nashmau
trigger Leleroon                        # Prog 4, Option 3: 287
finish
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Prog 5       # a GM: past the commission's Progs
trigger Leleroon                        # nothing: 264
finish
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Prog 4       # a GM
warp -58.7,-4.5,-39.6 PortSanDoria
trigger Raqtibahl                       # 756
finish                                  # the Frac; Completed 4; Prog, Option, Timer 0
trigger Raqtibahl                       # Option 0, the Frac made: 758
finish
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Option 1     # a GM: another commission
trigger Raqtibahl                       # Option 1, the Frac made: 758
finish
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Option 0     # a GM
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Completed 7  # a GM: all three made
warp -14.7,0,26.6 Nashmau
trigger Leleroon                        # Prog 0, Completed 7: nothing: 264
finish
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Completed 0  # a GM
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Prog 1       # a GM: Prog 1, Option 0
trigger Leleroon                        # Option 0: nothing: 264
